## Secrets — never commit credentials.
## The real DB connection string lives in dotnet user-secrets (outside the repo);
## these patterns are defensive so a stray credential file can't be added by accident.
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
